WEBVTT

00:13:58.716 --> 00:14:02.593
ali na druge važnije načine,

00:14:02.593 --> 00:14:05.187
tu je tim, i ako mislite da sam ja jaka,

00:14:05.187 --> 00:14:06.651
trebate upoznati Boni."

00:14:06.651 --> 00:14:08.026
(Smijeh)

00:14:08.026 --> 00:14:10.541
Boni, gdje si?

00:14:10.541 --> 00:14:13.164
Gdje si?

00:14:13.164 --> 00:14:16.954
Eno je Boni Stol. (Applause)

00:14:16.954 --> 00:14:19.276
Moja jaranica.

00:14:21.072 --> 00:14:23.541
Citat Henri Dejvid Torea kaže

00:14:23.541 --> 00:14:26.575
ono što dobijete kada ostvarite svoj cilj
nije toliko važno koliko ono

00:14:26.575 --> 00:14:29.501
šta postanete u procesu ostvarivanje tog cilja.

00:14:29.501 --> 00:14:31.639
I da sada stojim pred vama.